      "message": "This flag is only valid for ITE chipsets.  For Nuvoton you configure the low-power pins using the `def-lvol-io-list`.\n\nFor example:\n```\n\tdef-lvol-io-list {\n\t\tcompatible \u003d \"nuvoton,npcx-lvolctrl-def\";\n\t\tlvol-io-pads \u003d \u003c\u0026lvol_iob4 \u0026lvol_iob5\u003e; /* I2C_SDA0 \u0026 SCL0 */\n\t};\n```",
